src/mikemol/buildtel/bb_records.py|marker-kept-in-the-command|start \+ len\(SNIPPET_MARK\)|start|def=command
src/mikemol/buildtel/bb_records.py|command-runs-past-its-closing-quote|rest\.split\("'", 1\)\[0\]|rest.split("'", 1)[-1]|def=command
src/mikemol/buildtel/bb_records.py|head-not-bounded|snippet\[:SNIPPET_HEAD\]|snippet|def=command

