src/mikemol/buildtel/bb_records.py|peak-memory-summed-not-maxed|max\(tally\.peak_memory_max, _int\(usage\.get\("peakMemoryBytes"\)\)\)|tally.peak_memory_max + _int(usage.get("peakMemoryBytes"))|def=_add

